  m_Name: Viruses
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DevSidePage
  leftPageInfo: '<align=center><size=140%>- VIRUSES -</size></align>

    The <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>core
    threat</i></size></color> in Feverfall. Synthesize cures and vaccinate your population
    to survive.

    <align=center>- - - -</align>

    Infection Sources:

    Newcomers
    (<color=#305D42><size=110%><i>5%</i></size></color>): Introduces an undiscovered
    strain.

    Villagers (<color=#305D42><size=110%><i>6%</i></size></color>):
    Contracts an existing strain at random.'
