  rightPageInfo: '  <size=140%>- Virus Traits -</size>

    <b>Airborne</b>: <size=90%>Larger
    range, <color=#305D42><i>1.5x</i></color> Infection </size>

    <b>Overcrowding</b>:
    <size=90%>Infects motels at <color=#305D42><i>2x</i></color> rate.</size>

    <b>Muscle
    Atrophy</b>: <size=90%><color=#305D42><i>1.5x</i></color> severity, efficiency
    <color=#305D42><i>25%</i></color></size>

    <b>Hyper Metabolism</b>: <size=90%><color=#305D42><i>2x</i></color>
    Hunger drain</size>

    <b>Coughing</b>: <size=90%>Stuns villager & instant
    AOE infect.</size>

    <b>Exhaustion Insomnia</b>: <size=90%>Disrupts schedules.</size>

    <b>Sudden
    Collapse</b>: <size=90%>Dies leaving a <color=#305D42><i>2x</i></color> toxic
    corpse</size>'
